# Browser
# A card the Crystal exiled is drawn tucked under it, and its ability targets that card in exile, which nothing did before.
# On turn 3 Bot1's Shock kills Bot2's Memnite, and the Crystal exiles it for good: its tooltip says "Exiled with", not
# "until it leaves the battlefield". Portable Hole exiles Bot2's Ornithopter until the Hole leaves (CR 610.3), and that
# one says so. On turn 5 Bot1's page aims the Crystal's ability at the Memnite, which enters as a 3/3.
# The Darkness Crystal {2}{B}{B}: Legendary Artifact
#   Black spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.
#   If a nontoken creature an opponent controls would die, instead exile it and you gain 2 life.
#   {4}{B}{B}, {T}: Put target creature card exiled with The Darkness Crystal onto the battlefield tapped under your control with two additional +1/+1 counters on it.

